{'page_ID': 2, 'quote_ID': 1, 'quote_text': '“I love you without knowing how, or when, or from where. I love you simply, without problems or pride: I love you in this way because I do not know any other way of loving but this, in which there is no I or you, so intimate that your hand upon my chest is my hand, so intimate that when I fall asleep your eyes close.”', 'quote_author': 'Pablo Neruda', 'quote_tags': ['love', 'poetry']}
{'page_ID': 2, 'quote_ID': 2, 'quote_text': '“For every minute you are angry you lose sixty seconds of happiness.”', 'quote_author': 'Ralph Waldo Emerson', 'quote_tags': ['happiness']}
